# Code review

Full guide: `context/code-review.md`

## Before opening a PR

- One task per PR; minimal diff
- Run Checkpoint commands from active `docs/*.md`; report pass/fail in PR
- Confirm `.env` and secrets are not in `git diff`

## After opening a PR

- Stop and wait for **David** (or repo owner) to review
- Do not merge or push to `master` unless user explicitly requests after approval

## PR must include

- Summary (what + why)
- Doc/task reference (e.g. `docs/01-docker.md` Task 4)
- Test plan with Checkpoint command output
